From: MeowArchMobile adbd standalone build
Subject: [PATCH] fdevent.h: include <vector> explicitly

fdevent.h uses std::vector but never includes it; upstream relies on a
transitive include that differs between standard library versions
(libstdc++ vs libc++, and across versions). Add the include directly.

--- a/fdevent/fdevent.h
+++ b/fdevent/fdevent.h
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@
 #include <mutex>
 #include <optional>
 #include <set>
+#include <vector>
 #include <variant>
 
 #include <android-base/thread_annotations.h>
